Vercnocke, Bert and Vernieri, Daniele and Vicente, Rodrigo and Vitagliano, Vincenzo and Weltman, Amanda and Whiting, Bernard and Williamson, Andrew and Witek, Helvi and Wojnar, Aneta and Yakut, Kadri and Yan, Haopeng and Yazadjiev, Stoycho and Zaharijas, Gabrijela and Zilhão, Miguel},
	month = jun,
