	doi = {10.3847/1538-4365/aa6fb6},
	abstract = {Abstract
            
              We compile observations of early-type binaries identified via spectroscopy, eclipses, long-baseline interferometry, adaptive optics, common proper motion, etc. Each observational technique is sensitive to companions across a narrow parameter space of orbital periods
              P
              and mass ratios
